{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p002699","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p002699"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p002699","label":"昭魚（韓世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"昭魚","mention_ids":["c-shiji-045-han:m027-0256"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-045-han:m027-0256","chapter_id":"c-shiji-045-han","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-045-han:p027","quote":"昭魚"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-045-han","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-045","chapter_id":"c-shiji-045-han","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-045-han:m027-0256"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-045-han:p027"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-045-han"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m027-0256","start":256,"end":258,"surface":"昭魚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002699","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-045-han:p027","chapter_id":"c-shiji-045-han"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji045-077","person_id":"cbr-p002699","surfaces":["昭魚"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-045-han"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-045-han:p027","quote":"楚圍雍氏，韓求救於秦。秦未爲發，使公孫昧入韓。公仲曰：「子以秦爲且救韓乎？」對曰：「秦王之言曰『請道南鄭、藍田，出兵於楚以待公』，殆不合矣。」公仲曰：「子以爲果乎？」對曰：「秦王必祖張儀之故智。楚威王攻梁也，張儀謂秦王曰：『與楚攻魏，魏折而入於楚，韓固其與國也，是秦孤也。不如出兵以到之，魏楚大戰，秦取西河之外以歸。』今其狀陽言與韓，其實陰善楚。公待秦而到，必輕與楚戰。楚陰得秦之不用也，必易與公相支也。公戰而勝楚，遂與公乘楚，施三川而歸。公戰不勝楚，楚塞三川守之，公不能救也。竊爲公患之。司馬庚三反於郢，甘茂與昭魚遇於商於，其言收璽，實類有約也。」公仲恐，曰：「然則柰何？」曰：「公必先韓而後秦，先身而後張儀。公不如亟以國合於齊楚，齊楚必委國於公。公之所惡者張儀也，其實猶不無秦也。」於是楚解雍氏圍。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示姓名、號稱、是為與連續敘事；兩位韓武子、韓趙簡子、韓魏文侯及不同時段未名楚王分開。原字及韓姬弒悼公、蟣蝨等疑點不訂正；裸王與回敘指代留待核。","r